L192: # pone.0225600.s002
L193: The effect of vitamin D supplementation on cardiovascular risk factors in subjects with low serum 25-hydroxyvitamin D levels
L194: Version 6, 020516 (Protocol code number: TromsøEndo-2013-1)
L195: EUDRACT NR: 2013-003514-40. Vitamin D tilskudd og risiko for hjerte-kar sykdom
L196: Rolf Jorde, Elena Kamycheva, Johan Svartberg, Ragnar Joakimsen Guri Grimnes, Marie Kjærgaard, Yngve Figenschau, Ruth Paulssen, Jorid Degerstrøm, Arnfinn Andersen, Anne Sofie Furberg
L197: Tromsø Endocrine Research Group and Tromsø Gastroenterology Research Group, University of Tromsø, Norway.
