L547: The study will apply for a PhD candidate.
L548: Publication plan
L549: Kjersti Danielsen will be the first author of the main paper. The list of other authors on this first paper, and the list of authors on subsequent papers, will be decided by Kjersti Danielsen and Rolf Jorde.
